<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Argentine markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine financial markets were closed Monday for the national Flag Day holiday.</p>
<p>The markets, along with banks and other businesses, will reopen Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Gary Regenstreif, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
